{"3347830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HitTube", "steam_appid": 3347830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >===</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Right now HitTube is under development (Alpha stage) and most of the assets will be replaced</i><br>===</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HitTube is an open-world roguelike looter shooter, play solo or in 2–4 player co-op! You're a post-apocalyptic streamer who fights for donations while streaming your survival. Shoot, loot, trade and use magical cards to gain superpowers in a procedurally generated world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/860b45c71908bb914639d89166b05705.poster.avif?t=1788270759\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/860b45c71908bb914639d89166b05705.webm?t=1788270759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/860b45c71908bb914639d89166b05705.mp4?t=1788270759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Single player and co-op!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or team up with your friend in online co-op! Work together to cause chaos and stream your wild adventures while traveling the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/9ea5ac0f900091c230ff71ddac20b4c8.poster.avif?t=1788270759\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/9ea5ac0f900091c230ff71ddac20b4c8.webm?t=1788270759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/9ea5ac0f900091c230ff71ddac20b4c8.mp4?t=1788270759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use cards to gain superpowers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you level up, you can use a card to gain a superpower. Together they create special combos. Which cards will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/fecd093329e279adb8f1890ca447d2d0.poster.avif?t=1788270759\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/fecd093329e279adb8f1890ca447d2d0.webm?t=1788270759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/fecd093329e279adb8f1890ca447d2d0.mp4?t=1788270759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your own unique character!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character in the game is unique and you will create your own! Customize your character however you like. There are hundreds of cosmetic items available that you either get for free or from achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/078539cafb1b100974a11123bd23bf87.poster.avif?t=1788270759\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/078539cafb1b100974a11123bd23bf87.webm?t=1788270759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/078539cafb1b100974a11123bd23bf87.mp4?t=1788270759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Destruction, A LOT OF DESTRUCTION!!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HitTube uses a lot of physics and of course almost everything is destructible: walls, floors and decorations! Start hitting and shooting already!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/503961ac2bb014a6a79b6c7294aa0aff.poster.avif?t=1788270759\" width=470 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/503961ac2bb014a6a79b6c7294aa0aff.webm?t=1788270759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/503961ac2bb014a6a79b6c7294aa0aff.mp4?t=1788270759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Switch between first-person and third-person camera views!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can switch camera views at any time. You can also rotate the camera to find the angle that feels most comfortable for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A lot of other features!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory, dialogue system, procedural generation, random event system, territory system, game desktop and even social network inside of the game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HitTube doesn't use generative AI.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HitTube is made by a solo developer without using anyone else’s assets or generative AI. Every asset is handmade by the developer.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >===</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Right now HitTube is under development (Alpha stage) and most of the assets will be replaced</i><br>===</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HitTube is an open-world roguelike looter shooter, play solo or in 2–4 player co-op! You're a post-apocalyptic streamer who fights for donations while streaming your survival. Shoot, loot, trade and use magical cards to gain superpowers in a procedurally generated world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/860b45c71908bb914639d89166b05705.poster.avif?t=1788270759\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/860b45c71908bb914639d89166b05705.webm?t=1788270759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/860b45c71908bb914639d89166b05705.mp4?t=1788270759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Single player and co-op!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or team up with your friend in online co-op! Work together to cause chaos and stream your wild adventures while traveling the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/9ea5ac0f900091c230ff71ddac20b4c8.poster.avif?t=1788270759\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/9ea5ac0f900091c230ff71ddac20b4c8.webm?t=1788270759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/9ea5ac0f900091c230ff71ddac20b4c8.mp4?t=1788270759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use cards to gain superpowers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you level up, you can use a card to gain a superpower. Together they create special combos. Which cards will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_parag