tatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/503961ac2bb014a6a79b6c7294aa0aff.poster.avif?t=1788270759\" width=470 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/503961ac2bb014a6a79b6c7294aa0aff.webm?t=1788270759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/503961ac2bb014a6a79b6c7294aa0aff.mp4?t=1788270759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Switch between first-person and third-person camera views!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can switch camera views at any time. You can also rotate the camera to find the angle that feels most comfortable for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A lot of other features!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory, dialogue system, procedural generation, random event system, territory system, game desktop and even social network inside of the game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HitTube doesn't use generative AI.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HitTube is made by a solo developer without using anyone else’s assets or generative AI. Every asset is handmade by the developer.</p>", "short_description": "HitTube is an open-world roguelike looter shooter, play solo or in 2–4 player co-op! You're a post-apocalyptic streamer who fights for donations while streaming your survival. Shoot, loot, trade and use magical cards to gain superpowers in a procedurally generated world!", "supported_languages": "Uzbek", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/9ef2b1b012fe1fc9ce5a5d8f641d0ee18fe0c5fc/header.jpg?t=1788270759", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/818e166acd4033aa1a67e876c2a240abe143dff3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788270759", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/8